# ...but the graph data we *ship* is a deliverable, not a working directory.
# `_data/` above is meant to ignore the per-project graph a user generates when
# they init a template; it must not shadow the demo data this repo publishes.
# Re-include the directory first — git will not descend into an excluded dir,
# so negating the files alone would have no effect.
!docs/_data/
!examples/*/_data/
*.backup.json
*_backup*.json

